  "clips": [
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c1",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 5,
    "text": "Melos called across the hall,"
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c2",
    "voice": "melos",
    "wc": 13,
    "text": "\"You kill men from fear. You never give them a chance to speak.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c3",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 13,
    "text": "Silence came, and guards grabbed the young shepherd. The ruler ordered his death."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c4",
    "voice": "melos",
    "wc": 9,
    "text": "\"Give me three days to see my sister's wedding,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c5",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 2,
    "text": "Melos said."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c6",
    "voice": "melos",
    "wc": 6,
    "text": "\"Then I will return to you.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c7",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 5,
    "text": "The ruler smiled and said,"
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c8",
    "voice": "king",
    "wc": 14,
    "text": "\"Your friend must stay here. Return late, and he will die in your place.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c9",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 18,
    "text": "Melos turned to his friend, who offered his hands for the chains. Melos had no time to speak."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c10",
    "voice": "friend",
    "wc": 9,
    "text": "\"Go now, because I know you will come back.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c11",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 28,
    "text": "At the wedding, his sister's laugh rose above everyone's voices. Melos listened closely to remember its exact sound. He left for the city be"
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part2_c1",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 134,
    "text": "The river stopped him; its bridge was gone. Rain made the water brown and dangerously fast. He stepped back, ran, and jumped into the flood."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c1",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 68,
    "text": "He remembered the hands held out for the chains. His friend trusted him without asking for another promise. Water came slowly through a crac"
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c2",
    "voice": "melos",
    "wc": 4,
    "text": "\"Stop now! I'm back!\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c3",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 9,
    "text": "His friend turned around, and Melos fell against him."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c4",
    "voice": "melos",
    "wc": 6,
    "text": "\"I almost left you to die,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c5",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 3,
    "text": "he said softly."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c6",
    "voice": "friend",
    "wc": 7,
    "text": "\"I almost lost my trust in you,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c7",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 24,
    "text": "his friend replied. They held each other while the last sun lit the walls. The ruler kept his eyes on them. Finally, he said,"
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c8",
    "voice": "king",
    "wc": 8,
    "text": "\"Put the sword down and free both men.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c9",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 5,
    "text": "More softly, he then asked,"
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c10",
    "voice": "king",
    "wc": 7,
    "text": "\"How can a man win such trust?\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c11",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 11,
    "text": "For once, he waited for a reply instead of demanding one."
   }
  ]
 },
