    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 19,
    "text": "Melos turned to his friend, but before he could speak, his friend held out his hands for the chains."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c10",
    "voice": "friend",
    "wc": 6,
    "text": "\"Go. I know you'll come back.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part1_c11",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 33,
    "text": "At the wedding, his sister's laughter rose above the other voices. Melos listened closely. He wanted to remember exactly how it sounded. Bef"
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part2_c1",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 124,
    "text": "At the river, he stopped. The bridge was gone. Rain had turned the water brown and violent. He stepped back, ran, and threw himself into the"
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c1",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 61,
    "text": "Then he remembered the hands held out for the chains. His friend had trusted him without asking for another promise. Water dripped from a cr"
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c2",
    "voice": "melos",
    "wc": 4,
    "text": "\"Stop! I am here!\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c3",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 7,
    "text": "His friend turned. Melos fell against him."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c4",
    "voice": "melos",
    "wc": 4,
    "text": "\"I nearly abandoned you,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c5",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 2,
    "text": "he whispered."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c6",
    "voice": "friend",
    "wc": 4,
    "text": "\"I nearly stopped believing,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c7",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 19,
    "text": "his friend answered. They held each other as the last sunlight touched the walls. The ruler stared at them."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c8",
    "voice": "king",
    "wc": 3,
    "text": "\"Lower the sword,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c9",
    "voice": "narrator",
