    "text": "he said at last."
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c10",
    "voice": "king",
    "wc": 3,
    "text": "\"Free them both.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "full_story_part3_c11",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 5,
    "text": "Then, more quietly, he asked,"
