  "clips": [
   {
    "id": "story_001",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 42,
    "text": "In a small kingdom, the ruler, Dionysius, was afraid of enemies. If anyone spoke against him, his guards could take that person to prison. O"
   },
   {
    "id": "story_002",
    "voice": "q1",
    "wc": 8,
    "text": "\"You punish people before you know the truth,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_003",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 2,
    "text": "Melos said."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_004",
    "voice": "q0",
    "wc": 4,
    "text": "\"That is not justice.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_005",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 5,
    "text": "The ruler's face became hard."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_006",
    "voice": "q1",
    "wc": 4,
    "text": "\"Then you will die.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_007",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 15,
    "text": "Melos's sister was going to be married in three days. He fell to his knees."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_008",
    "voice": "q0",
    "wc": 7,
    "text": "\"Please let me go to her wedding,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_009",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 2,
    "text": "he said."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_010",
    "voice": "q1",
    "wc": 6,
    "text": "\"I will return before my death.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_011",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 3,
    "text": "The ruler laughed."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_012",
    "voice": "q0",
    "wc": 5,
    "text": "\"Why should I believe you?\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_013",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 5,
    "text": "Melos's friend, Selinuntius, stepped forward."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_014",
    "voice": "q1",
    "wc": 7,
    "text": "\"I will stay here in his place.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_015",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 148,
    "text": "So the ruler agreed. Melos had three days to go and return. If he did not come back, his friend would die. Melos ran from the city. He reach"
   },
   {
    "id": "story_016",
    "voice": "q0",
    "wc": 4,
    "text": "\"I cannot do this,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_017",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 2,
    "text": "he whispered."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_018",
    "voice": "q1",
    "wc": 6,
    "text": "\"Perhaps my friend is already dead.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_019",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 26,
    "text": "For a moment, he wanted to hide in the forest. Then he remembered his friend's calm face. His friend had trusted him enough to face death."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_020",
    "voice": "q0",
    "wc": 1,
    "text": "\"No,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_021",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 2,
    "text": "Melos said."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_022",
    "voice": "q1",
    "wc": 4,
    "text": "\"I gave my word.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_023",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 22,
    "text": "He stood and ran. At the city gate, the guards were leading his friend to the place of execution. Then Melos shouted,"
   },
   {
    "id": "story_024",
    "voice": "q0",
    "wc": 1,
    "text": "\"Wait!\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_025",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 7,
    "text": "Everyone turned. Melos fell before the ruler."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_026",
    "voice": "q1",
    "wc": 4,
    "text": "\"I promised to return,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_027",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 2,
    "text": "he said."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_028",
    "voice": "q0",
    "wc": 3,
    "text": "\"I am here.\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_029",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 12,
    "text": "The ruler looked at the two friends. Slowly, he lowered his hand."
   },
   {
    "id": "story_030",
    "voice": "q1",
    "wc": 2,
    "text": "\"Free him,\""
   },
   {
    "id": "story_031",
    "voice": "narrator",
    "wc": 22,
    "text": "he said. After that day, the ruler demanded fair trials. He had learned that trust and loyalty could be stronger than fear."
   }
  ],
